    "dcbcadde4c782ba6": {
      "src": "Quote pair inserted when you type a plain double quote in the editor. Existing text and pasted text are unchanged.",
      "tgt": "在编辑器中输入普通双引号时插入引号对。现有文本和粘贴文本保持不变。",
