    "855fceedb1dea865": {
      "src": "The status bar entry shows the label `Custom sort:ON` or `Custom sort:OFF`, representing the current state of the plugin.",
      "tgt": "状态栏条目显示标签 `自定义排序：开` 或 `自定义排序：关`，代表插件的当前状态。",
