    },
    "d90e9850da91f9c7": {
      "src": "The plugin can show notifications about its state changes: e.g. when successfully parsed and applied the custom sorting specification, or, when the parsing failed. If the notifications are disabled, the only indicator of plugin state is the ribbon button icon. The developer console presents the parsing error messages regardless if the notifications are enabled or not.",
      "tgt": "该插件可以显示其状态变化的通知：例如，成功解析并应用自定义排序规范时，或解析失败时。如果通知被禁用，插件状态的唯一指示器是功能区按钮图标。无论通知是否启用，开发者控制台都会显示解析错误消息。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789477345760
    },
    "55edb8bb901237f1": {
