      "updatedAt": 1789477345698
    },
    "9f2df0af9dcb53b5": {
      "src": "\"Commit-and-sync\" and \"pull\" takes care of submodules. Missing features: Conflicted files, count of pulled/pushed/committed files. Tracking branch needs to be set for each submodule.",
      "tgt": "“提交并同步”和“拉取”会处理子模块。缺少的功能：冲突文件、拉取/推送/提交的文件计数。需要为每个子模块设置跟踪分支。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 3,
      "updatedAt": 1789477345698
    },
    "bc67a8ceb0deda25": {
      "src": "Custom Git binary path",
      "tgt": "自定义 Git 可执行文件路径",
