    },
    "e8c572c2d3374856": {
      "src": "Requires the commit-and-sync interval not to be 0.\n                        If turned on, do auto commit-and-sync every 0 minutes after stopping file edits.\n                        This also prevents auto commit-and-sync while editing a file. If turned off, it's independent from the last file edit.",
      "tgt": "要求提交并同步的间隔不为0。\n开启后，将在停止编辑文件后的0分钟自动提交并同步。\n这也会防止在编辑文件时自动提交并同步。关闭后，则与最后一次文件编辑无关。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789477345473
    },
    "4a58f4529dc08858": {
      "src": "On commit-and-sync, pull commits as well. Turning this off turns a commit-and-sync action into commit and push only.",
      "tgt": "提交并同步时也拉取提交。关闭此选项后，提交并同步操作将仅执行提交和推送。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 1,
      "updatedAt": 1789477345473
    },
    "adf6f5c06d9634fb": {
      "src": "Most of the time you want to push after committing. Turning this off turns a commit-and-sync action into commit and pull only. It will still be called commit-and-sync.",
      "tgt": "大多数情况下，你希望在提交后推送。关闭此选项会将提交并同步操作变为仅提交和拉取。该操作仍会被称为提交并同步。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 2,
      "updatedAt": 1789477345473
    },
