    },
    "f084e94ba3f82270": {
      "src": "This allows you to see your changes right in your editor via colored markers and stage/reset/preview individual hunks.",
      "tgt": "这让你可以通过彩色标记在编辑器中直接查看更改，并暂存/重置/预览各个代码块。",
