    "fb06653e15f975a3": {
      "src": "After the high of the midpoint, uncertainty sets in. Old fears resurface and the heroes start to let their doubts get the better of them.",
      "tgt": "在故事高潮过后，不确定性随之而来。旧日的恐惧再次浮现，英雄们开始让疑虑占据上风。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "feca7b924e8bc5cf": {
      "src": "Deepening Doubt",
      "tgt": "加深怀疑",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "54980c5d48ceb141": {
      "src": "Insecurities run high. A misunderstanding or external pressure exploits the original \"no way\" reasons and drives the heroes apart.",
      "tgt": "不安全感高涨。误解或外部压力利用最初的“不可能”理由，使英雄们分道扬镳。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "991c11461f5bedd8": {
      "src": "Retreat",
      "tgt": "撤退",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "5e1541f7abca854d": {
      "src": "It’s all too much. To stay safe, the heroes retreat and misunderstand each other. Trust is broken; the pain of connection feels too great.",
      "tgt": "这一切都太沉重了。为了安全，英雄们撤退了，彼此误解。信任破裂；连接的痛苦太过强烈。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "7bb3818259965aad": {
      "src": "Shields Up",
      "tgt": "护盾开启",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "3d00093366c674fb": {
      "src": "The worst has happened — the \"no way\" fear has come true. The protagonist reaffirms their commitment to hardening their heart and being alone.",
      "tgt": "最糟的事情发生了——“绝无可能”的恐惧成真了。主角重申了自己铁石心肠、独自一人的决心。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "92862fe75979b5fd": {
      "src": "Break Up",
      "tgt": "拆分",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "1d07b301cef2da94": {
      "src": "It’s over. The relationship ends and the reader cannot tell if the heroes will find their way back. The protagonist chose not to be vulnerable.",
      "tgt": "结束了。这段关系画上句号，读者无法判断主角们能否重归于好。主角选择了不再袒露脆弱。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "e5489596d8db6c46": {
      "src": "The protagonist wallows after the breakup. They should feel better, but feel worse. They relive happy memories and hint at a way back.",
      "tgt": "主角在分手后沉溺其中。他们本该感觉更好，却感觉更糟。他们重温快乐回忆，并暗示着一条回头路。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "f028886b7115c28e": {
      "src": "Wake Up",
      "tgt": "唤醒",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "3215674c50bbb2ad": {
      "src": "The protagonist chooses love over fear. They realize they have agency and decide to address their flaws and fight for the relationship.",
      "tgt": "主角选择了爱而非恐惧。他们意识到自己拥有主动权，并决定正视自身的缺点，为这段关系而战。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "2f3a39661001b1ff": {
      "src": "Grand Gesture",
      "tgt": "盛大姿态",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "a6db7463011c10e4": {
      "src": "One character takes a big risk to show they have changed and their love can conquer all. The gesture must be big enough to make up for past errors.",
      "tgt": "一个角色冒着巨大风险，证明自己已经改变，爱能战胜一切。这个举动必须足够盛大，才能弥补过去的过错。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "599b60fd7f151fa6": {
      "src": "Whole-Hearted",
      "tgt": "全情投入",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "255a16d91a467f5c": {
      "src": "It worked. The heroes are together, have addressed the issues that kept them apart, and are ready for their happily ever after.",
      "tgt": "成功了。英雄们重归于好，解决了彼此间的隔阂，准备迎接他们的幸福结局。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
    "c59153bd401112e0": {
      "src": "A glimpse into the future: the heroes living their lives together, both changed for good. A moment of celebration and reader payoff.",
      "tgt": "未来一瞥：英雄们共同生活，彼此都发生了永久的改变。一个庆祝的时刻，也是读者的回报。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
      "updatedAt": 1789198536879
    },
