    },
    "42046e33393b10bb": {
      "src": "One hero denies (internally or externally) that they will ever fall in love, especially not with this person. Make the argument compelling.",
      "tgt": "一位主角（内心或对外）否认自己会坠入爱河，尤其是不会爱上这个人。让这个理由令人信服。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 0,
