    "bb18ebd04d1893c1": {
      "src": "An event or situation forces the heroes to stay close and work together toward a shared goal. They cannot walk away from each other.",
      "tgt": "某个事件或情境迫使英雄们紧密合作，朝着共同目标努力。他们无法离开彼此。",
