    },
    "daadad8459e8a828": {
      "src": "Despite being stuck together, the protagonist fights their feelings and restates the argument against love. External and internal goals clash.",
      "tgt": "尽管被困在一起，主角压抑着自己的感情，重申反对爱情的理由。外在目标与内心渴望相互冲突。",
