    "d0f8112be3ba6646": {
      "src": "Fetch the content of an X (Twitter) post using Copilot Plus. Use when the user shares an x.com or twitter.com URL and wants its text or context. Requires an active Copilot Plus license.",
      "tgt": "使用 Copilot Plus 获取 X（Twitter）帖子内容。当用户分享 x.com 或 twitter.com 链接并希望获取其文本或上下文时使用。需要有效的 Copilot Plus 许可证。",
      "provider": "openai",
