      "src": ": Your input, attached files, images, and tool call outputs. Depending on the selected provider, data is sent to Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (Codex), xAI (Grok), or the providers configured in OpenCode or Pi. The destination can be configured through provider settings and environment variables.",
      "tgt": "您的输入、附件文件、图片和工具调用输出。根据所选提供商，数据将发送至 Anthropic (Claude)、OpenAI (Codex)、xAI (Grok)，或 OpenCode 或 Pi 中配置的提供商。目标位置可通过提供商设置和环境变量进行配置。",
