    "c1e0ffe27cca44ce": {
      "src": "\"The first tool that truly unifies how I search, organize, and retrieve knowledge without ever leaving Obsidian. My workflow is faster, deeper, and more connected. I can't imagine working without it.\"",
      "tgt": "“第一款真正将我在 Obsidian 中的知识搜索、整理与检索统一起来的工具。我的工作流更快、更深入、更互联。我无法想象没有它该如何工作。”",
