      "tgt": "右侧边栏聊天面板，由 Claude Code 驱动。以当前仓库为工作目录，将 `claude` CLI 作为子进程运行。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 6,
      "updatedAt": 1789123650676
    },
