    "58b1876850abd8d0": {
      "src": "When on, the spawned `claude` CLI ignores ~/.claude.json and the project's .mcp.json and starts without any MCP servers. Default: off (MCP enabled). Browser pop-ups that servers like Serena try to open are blocked separately by overriding the `open`/`xdg-open` commands on PATH.",
      "tgt": "开启时，生成的 `claude` CLI 会忽略 ~/.claude.json 和项目的 .mcp.json，并在没有任何 MCP 服务器的情况下启动。默认：关闭（启用 MCP）。Serena 等服务器尝试打开的浏览器弹窗会通过在 PATH 上覆盖 `open`/`xdg-open` 命令来单独阻止。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "4a268c8f86daa89a": {
      "src": "Tool approval mode",
      "tgt": "工具审批模式",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "d9c4ccf9eb4b791f": {
      "src": "How Claude behaves when invoking tools such as Edit / Bash / MCP. 'Ask before edits' shows Approve / Deny buttons in the chat. 'Edit automatically' auto-approves file edits only; Bash and MCP still ask. 'Bypass permissions' runs everything without confirmation (legacy behavior). 'Plan mode' returns a plan only, with no tool execution.",
      "tgt": "Claude 调用 Edit / Bash / MCP 等工具时的行为方式。“编辑前询问”会在聊天中显示批准 / 拒绝按钮。“自动编辑”仅自动批准文件编辑；Bash 和 MCP 仍会询问。“绕过权限”无需确认即可运行所有操作（旧版行为）。“计划模式”仅返回计划，不执行任何工具。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "67e90da50090fb67": {
      "src": "Model",
      "tgt": "模型",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 16,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "3ddc61e1319a0468": {
      "src": "Claude model used for new messages. Can also be changed from the dropdown at the bottom of the chat panel. Aliases resolve to the latest version (default = your account default, best = Fable 5 if available and otherwise the latest Opus, opusplan = Opus for planning and Sonnet for execution). The [1m] variants run the same model with a 1M-token context window — about 5× more headroom before auto-compaction than the standard 200K, but responses get heavier and rate limits are consumed faster. Some plans don't support the 1M variants; switch back to the standard alias if the CLI errors.",
      "tgt": "用于新消息的 Claude 模型。也可从聊天面板底部的下拉菜单中更改。别名解析为最新版本（default = 你的账户默认值，best = Fable 5（若可用），否则为最新版 Opus，opusplan = Opus 用于规划，Sonnet 用于执行）。[1m] 变体以 1M token 上下文窗口运行同一模型——自动压缩前的余量约为标准 200K 的 5 倍，但响应更重，速率限制消耗更快。部分套餐不支持 1M 变体；若 CLI 报错，请切换回标准别名。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "8d8691d45e5a1325": {
      "src": "Thinking (extended thinking)",
      "tgt": "思考（扩展思考）",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "9b2906f44ab3a016": {
      "src": "Initial thinking mode for new messages. Can also be changed from the dropdown at the bottom of the chat panel. On/off matches the official Claude Code thinking toggle (alwaysThinkingEnabled); ultrathink additionally prefixes each turn with the keyword to request the deepest reasoning. Fable 5 always thinks and cannot be turned off.",
      "tgt": "新消息的初始思考模式。也可从聊天面板底部的下拉菜单中更改。开/关对应官方 Claude Code 思考开关（alwaysThinkingEnabled）；ultrathink 还会在每轮对话前加上关键词以请求最深度的推理。Fable 5 始终思考，无法关闭。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "5787d6ac8d98cd22": {
      "src": "Effort (reasoning depth)",
      "tgt": "思考强度",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "0c65bd468357c1b7": {
      "src": "Reasoning depth. Same options as the official Claude Code `/effort` (`xhigh` needs a capable model such as Opus 4.7+, Fable 5 or Sonnet 5). `auto` defers to the CLI / `~/.claude/settings.json` default. Haiku does not support effort, so the value is ignored.",
      "tgt": "推理深度。与官方 Claude Code `/effort` 选项相同（`xhigh` 需要 Opus 4.7+、Fable 5 或 Sonnet 5 等高性能模型）。`auto` 遵循 CLI / `~/.claude/settings.json` 默认值。Haiku 不支持 effort，该值将被忽略。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "2f2007c133449b2d": {
      "src": "Include the active file / folder by default",
      "tgt": "默认包含活动文件/文件夹",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "be674ab8ffc1917b": {
      "src": "When on, the active file (or folder) is included in the prompt when the chat panel opens. When off, it starts excluded. Either way you can flip it per turn with the \"Include / Exclude\" toggle in the panel.",
      "tgt": "开启时，聊天面板打开时会将活动文件（或文件夹）包含在提示中。关闭时，则默认排除。无论哪种方式，你都可以在面板中使用“包含 / 排除”开关按轮次切换。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "9732ab9fe66ea317": {
      "src": "Save attachments inside the vault",
      "tgt": "将附件保存到库内",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
    "89089aa094f9800f": {
      "src": "When on, attached and pasted files are saved inside the vault. When off, pasted images go to the plugin's temporary folder (removed when Obsidian quits), and attached files are referenced by their original absolute path. This value becomes the initial state of the \"Save to vault\" checkbox in the chat panel.",
      "tgt": "开启时，附件和粘贴的文件会保存到库内。关闭时，粘贴的图片会存入插件临时文件夹（Obsidian 退出时清除），附件则按原始绝对路径引用。此值将成为聊天面板中“保存到库”复选框的初始状态。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123647675
    },
