    "4eb186aad0b21a8f": {
      "src": "How to notify when Claude finishes responding. Flash briefly highlights the panel border. Sound plays the built-in chime, or the audio file you specify below. Runs that you cancelled yourself are not notified.",
      "tgt": "Claude 响应完成时如何通知。闪烁会短暂高亮面板边框。声音会播放内置提示音，或您在下方指定的音频文件。您自行取消的运行不会通知。",
