      "src": "Audio file used for the notification (mp3 / wav / ogg / m4a, etc.). Files inside the vault are saved as relative paths so they follow you to other devices via vault sync. Leave blank to use the built-in short chime.",
      "tgt": "通知使用的音频文件（mp3 / wav / ogg / m4a 等）。库内的文件以相对路径保存，因此会通过库同步跟随你到其他设备。留空则使用内置的短提示音。",
