    "58359628a7abefc2": {
      "src": "When ON, plain Enter only inserts a newline. You submit via the key bound to the \"Claude Panel: Send prompt\" command in Obsidian's Hotkeys settings (default: Shift+Enter, customizable). When OFF (default), Enter submits.",
      "tgt": "开启时，普通回车仅插入换行。您需通过 Obsidian 热键设置中绑定到“Claude Panel: Send prompt”命令的按键提交（默认：Shift+Enter，可自定义）。关闭时（默认），回车提交。",
      "provider": "openai",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "from": "unknown@",
      "hits": 14,
      "updatedAt": 1789123642708
    },
    "3c1d95a9b882e0e2": {
      "src": "Commands such as Open Panel / Focus Input / Send / Cancel / Clear conversation / Cycle model can be assigned freely from Obsidian's built-in Hotkeys settings.",
      "tgt": "打开面板 / 聚焦输入 / 发送 / 取消 / 清空对话 / 切换模型等命令，可在 Obsidian 内置的快捷键设置中自由分配。",
